<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Boise City, Idaho.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Boise City, Idaho.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle-Northwest Securities Corp said it received the written award for the $1.445 Boise City, Idaho, certificates of participation (Fire Station #12 Project) Series 1997 A with a top yield of 5.20 percent in 2006.</p>
